\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the IP rating and how does it protect the display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"This product has an IP65 rating, meaning it is fully protected against dust ingress and resistant to water jets, ensuring reliable outdoor operation.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How is the PosterLED Outdoor 2.5mm cooled during operation?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It features an integrated smart fan cooling system within its durable die-cast aluminium housing to maintain optimal operating temperatures.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What connectivity options are available for content management?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Remote content updates are possible via 4G, 5G, and WiFi, enabling flexible and easy management from anywhere.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty support is provided?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx offers a standard manufacturer warranty covering parts and labor for defined periods; please contact us for specific warranty terms.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does this product compare with other outdoor digital posters?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"PosterLED Outdoor 2.5mm combines a fine pixel pitch with high 4,000 nit brightness and robust IP65 protection, making it more suitable for high-detail outdoor applications than larger pixel pitch alternatives.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What are typical installation environments for the PosterLED Outdoor 2.5mm?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It's designed for installations in street furniture, outdoor retail locations, and smart city environments where durable, high-brightness digital signage is required.\"}}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Products\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"PosterLED Outdoor 2.5mm\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-ptr250\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"legalName\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"contactPoint\": {\"@type\": \"ContactPoint\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"contactType\": \"sales\", \"areaServed\": [\"AE\", \"SA\", \"QA\", \"KW\", \"BH\", \"OM\"], \"availableLanguage\": [\"en\", \"ar\"]}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"LocalBusiness\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"image\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"priceRange\": \"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\u00b2\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"geo\": {\"@type\": \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\": 24.9857, \"longitude\": 55.0272}, \"openingHoursSpecification\": {\"@type\": \"OpeningHoursSpecification\", \"dayOfWeek\": [\"Monday\", \"Tuesday\", \"Wednesday\", \"Thursday\", \"Friday\", \"Saturday\"], \"opens\": \"09:00\", \"closes\": \"18:00\